/*
# Seed 20 Croatian cities

1. Data
- Inserts 20 major Croatian cities into the `cities` table with name, slug,
  region, short + long descriptions, a representative photo URL, and
  approximate lat/lng coordinates.
- Cities: Zagreb, Split, Dubrovnik, Zadar, Rovinj, Pula, Šibenik, Varaždin,
  Rijeka, Osijek, Hvar, Korčula, Trogir, Makarska, Cavtat, Opatija, Poreč,
  Motovun, Vis, Ston.
2. Idempotency
- Uses ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING so re-running is safe.
3. Security
- No schema changes; INSERT relies on the existing public_insert-style
  grants already applied in the schema migration.
*/

ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;